# public/build is deliberately committed: cPanel has no Node build step, so the
# compiled assets have to ship in the repo. Rebuild and commit them whenever
# anything under resources/ changes, or the deployed site serves stale assets.
# /public/hot stays ignored: it is a dev-server marker, and deploying it makes
# Laravel try to load assets from a localhost Vite server.
